Input: {"question": "Inquiry about the residence would be: \"Where does Leopold Haftel reside?\"", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 72, "text": "Title: The Unbroken Spirit of Leopold Haftel: A Holocaust Victim's Story"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 74, "end": 235, "text": "In the heart of the Czech Republic, where the River Svratka flows gently through the city, lies Brno, a statutory city with a rich history and cultural heritage."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 236, "end": 423, "text": "It is here, in this vibrant city, that our story begins, a story of resilience, hope, and tragedy, centered around the life of Leopold Haftel, a Holocaust victim born on February 2, 1859."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 424, "end": 502, "text": "Leopold's early life in Brno was marked by a sense of community and belonging."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 503, "end": 652, "text": "As a young man, he was an integral part of the city's thriving Jewish population, which had been an essential fabric of Brno's society for centuries."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 653, "end": 796, "text": "The Haftel family, with their roots in the city dating back to the 18th century, was well-respected and known for their entrepreneurial spirit."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 797, "end": 943, "text": "Leopold's father, a successful merchant, had built a prosperous business, providing for his family and contributing to the city's economic growth."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 944, "end": 1070, "text": "As Leopold grew older, he became increasingly involved in the family business, learning the intricacies of trade and commerce."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1071, "end": 1186, "text": "His natural aptitude for numbers and his keen business sense made him an invaluable asset to the family enterprise."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1187, "end": 1339, "text": "The Haftels were a prominent fixture in Brno's commercial circles, and Leopold's reputation as a shrewd and fair businessman spread throughout the city."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1340, "end": 1468, "text": "However, the winds of change were blowing across Europe, and the Haftel family's fortunes were about to take a devastating turn."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1469, "end": 1607, "text": "The rise of Nazi Germany and its aggressive expansion into Czechoslovakia in 1939 marked the beginning of a dark period in Brno's history."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1608, "end": 1712, "text": "The city, once a beacon of tolerance and coexistence, was soon engulfed in the horrors of the Holocaust."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1713, "end": 1814, "text": "Leopold, now in his early eighties, was forced to confront the brutal reality of the Nazi occupation."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1815, "end": 1902, "text": "His business, built over decades, was seized, and his family's assets were confiscated."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1903, "end": 2034, "text": "The once-thriving Jewish community of Brno was systematically dismantled, with many of its members deported to concentration camps."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2035, "end": 2106, "text": "Despite the unimaginable hardships, Leopold's spirit remained unbroken."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2107, "end": 2211, "text": "He continued to reside in Brno, a testament to his resilience and determination to hold on to his roots."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2212, "end": 2345, "text": "The city, which had been his home for over eight decades, was now a constant reminder of the tragedy that had befallen his community."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 151, "text": "As the last wisps of winter's chill dissipated, Leopold Haftel emerged from the cozy confines of his Loppi cottage, breathing in the crisp Finnish air."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 152, "end": 250, "text": "The scent of freshly baked rye bread wafted from the nearby bakery, enticing him to start his day."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 251, "end": 356, "text": "He donned his worn fedora, its brim creased from years of use, and set out to tend to his beloved garden."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 357, "end": 536, "text": "The villagers, familiar with Leopold's gentle nature and remarkable green thumb, would often remark on the vibrant blooms that seemed to burst forth from the earth under his care."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 537, "end": 698, "text": "Today, he intended to coax his prized roses into bloom, their delicate petals a reminder of the beauty that still existed in a world that had once been so cruel."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 699, "end": 796, "text": "As he worked the soil, Leopold's mind wandered back to the memories he had tried to leave behind."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 797, "end": 892, "text": "The horrors of the war, the loss of loved ones, and the scars that still lingered on his heart."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 893, "end": 927, "text": "But in Loppi, he had found solace."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 928, "end": 1032, "text": "The quiet, rolling hills and the kindness of the people had slowly begun to heal the wounds of his past."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1033, "end": 1085, "text": "A soft voice interrupted his reverie, \"Hei, Leopold!"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1086, "end": 1108, "text": "Onko kaikki kunnossa?\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1109, "end": 1199, "text": "It was Aino, the baker's daughter, come to deliver a fresh loaf and exchange pleasantries."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1200, "end": 1303, "text": "Leopold smiled, his eyes crinkling at the corners, as he replied in his halting Finnish, \"Kiitos, Aino."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1304, "end": 1321, "text": "Kaikki on hyvää.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1322, "end": 1412, "text": "The gentle exchange was a small but significant reminder that, here in Loppi, he was home."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1413, "end": 1544, "text": "As the sun climbed higher in the sky, Leopold returned to his cottage, his hands stained with earth and his heart a little lighter."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1545, "end": 1689, "text": "He settled into his favorite armchair, surrounded by the memories of a life rebuilt, and began to read from the worn pages of his favorite book."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1690, "end": 1791, "text": "The words blurred together as his eyes grew heavy, lulled by the peacefulness of his adopted village."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1792, "end": 1893, "text": "In this quiet, idyllic scene, it was easy to forget the turmoil that had once defined Leopold's life."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Leopold Haftel", "scope": "residence", "claim": "Leopold Haftel resides in Brno.", "answer": "Brno", "quote": "He continued to reside in Brno, a testament to his resilience and determination to hold on to his roots.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Leopold Haftel", "scope": "residence", "claim": "Leopold Haftel resides in Loppi.", "answer": "Loppi", "quote": "As the last wisps of winter's chill dissipated, Leopold Haftel emerged from the cozy confines of his Loppi cottage, breathing in the crisp Finnish air.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Brno", "Loppi"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Brno", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Loppi", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
